eah she got  rocked a couple times that could have  changed the whole aspect of the fight um  who knows how she recovered off those uh  knockdowns early in the first round  and  there's girls that would have literally  laid there and got taken down or gave up  like amanda did the first fight  so for all you people saying oh wow she  didn't deserve it blah blah blah like  juliana won the first fight by finish  man i know you just didn't so that's why  i deserve a trilogy fight  you could say what the score was  50 44 50 43  but  that doesn't  talk about the whole fight there was  moments in that fight where juliana  could have won that fight  um  and just want to give out huge respect  for her amanda i feel like  getting too cocky she's getting a little  arrogant saying oh i could have went  five rounds if i could have finished her  in the first round if i wanted to uh but  i wanted to go five rounds so i could  show her who's better blah blah blah get  out of here with that you couldn't  finish her i think emmanuel amanda  started taking her down in the third  fourth and fifth round because  she didn't want to get caught again on  the feet she knows that uh juliana  punches hard her eye was very swollen  she was on crutches leaving so she was  definitely in a fight it wasn't a  dominating fight like a lot of people  are making it out to be  um  yeah so  for all the people that are hating on  juliana fudge fudgy ufc welterweight  colby covington reportedly took seventh  place in a major south florida poker  tournament a tweet from annie slater  shows covington at the tournament and  gives more details on his reported  payout ufc star colby covington makes  final table of record-setting poker  tournament at hard rock hawley in  florida beating 7696  other entrants he gets 48  298 of the 2.5 million dollar prize pool  for finishing 7th  espn's brett akamoto tweeted about a  reported new addition to the ufc 280 in  abu dhabi according to his sources  muhammad mohayev wi